This method doesn't feel right. It's called `formatModernPath` but doesn't do it if the feature is disabled.

IMO, this method should look like this with the remaining code updated:
```js
function formatModernPath(path: string) {
  return path.replace(/\.js$/, '.module.js')
}
```

